@* Recette R-22: one tile of the Capabilities step is an OE selectable card (a short title and a short line) and, beside it, a "?"
   that opens a dialog with the longer explanation. A selectable card is one button and holds nothing interactive, so the "?" is
   a sibling laid over the card's corner (.pipeline-setup-tile in app.css), never inside it. *@
<div class="@(Waiting ? "pipeline-setup-tile pipeline-setup-tile--waiting" : "pipeline-setup-tile")" data-testid="@($"setup-tile-{Key}")">
    @Card
    <OmniButton Variant="OmniButtonVariant.Ghost" Size="OmniControlSize.Small" Class="pipeline-setup-tile__help"
                Label="@L["PipelineSetupTileHelpLabel", Title].Value" OnClick="@ShowHelpAsync"
                data-testid="@($"setup-help-{Key}")">
        <Icon><OmniIcon Name="OmniIconName.Question" /></Icon>
    </OmniButton>
</div>
